[{"client_msg_id":"441d14e2-7127-4d7c-9a55-130a22a7f2b8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あああ。そうです。安定ソートじゃないということです！","ts":"1618669444.227600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5IZMI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68b629e6-cf90-4109-8b6e-e65a6a07f997","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"なるほど、新しいソーターを自分で書くしかなさそうですね。","ts":"1618668645.227500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KNNNi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96062679-a94d-4b05-a160-8e9362b7fcb6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"中のアルゴリズムは何なんだろう。クイックソートかな。","ts":"1618668220.226800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d=D2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7274a7fc-e880-4945-a08d-8ffb37d9e52b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ほんとだ。調べてみると安定ではない、とありますね。","ts":"1618668153.226500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jKo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a838614-55b8-4fea-aca3-c3ff2b270dfb","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"ん〜、とすると独自にリスト順に index を返却する関数を書く必要がありそうですね。","ts":"1618668143.226200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJBW8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f170b81b-f7e7-4fd5-95aa-58644b799920","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"安全じゃないというのは安定性のことですか？","ts":"1618668081.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zvT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df081538-96bb-413a-910b-1ca77dab3c93","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Lua の native のソート機能は安全じゃないっぽいので item_index ソーターみたいのが必要そうですね","ts":"1618667896.224200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UwR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7cdcd69-ef7c-4c2a-9a70-122e925c0311","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"想定としては、`{ 'hoge.lua', 'lua' }` という候補があり、`lua` と入力すると、 `hoge.lua` `lua`  となる想定でした。","ts":"1618663191.224100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G9yOw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc73f274-c4fa-4e48-8ee0-e51d298f546c","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"試しに sorters.lua で定義されている、sorters.get_fzy_sorter() を設定してみたのですが、想定とは違う動きになってしまいました。\nsorters.empty は初めて知りました。ですが、ソートされませんでした...。","ts":"1618662959.222000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UBT20"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf4dadb-a77c-4057-9c2c-49cf32296954","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"file_sorter あるいは generic_sorter を設定してやればできるのではないかと。\nドキュメントには出ていませんが sorters.empty とかあるようです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/blob/master/lua/telescope/sorters.lua\u003e","ts":"1618657075.218700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","id":1,"title":"nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","title_link":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/blob/master/lua/telescope/sorters.lua","text":"Find, Filter, Preview, Pick. All lua, all the time. - nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74419533?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/blob/master/lua/telescope/sorters.lua","original_url":"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/blob/master/lua/telescope/sorters.lua"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qsvN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5769b5e2-fc71-429a-9b25-12b75f054e21","type":"message","user":"UFP0GQZ4K","text":"telescope を使っている方に聞きたいのですが、\ntelescope でリストの順序を保持しつつフィルタする設定ってありますか？\nmru とかでリストの順序はそのままでフィルタする設定を自分で書いているのですが、\n標準の機能でできるのであれば、それを使いたいと思っています。","ts":"1618652853.215300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UIL"}]}]
